### =====================================================================
### Cereri de test pentru Auction Engine (extensia VS Code "REST Client")
###
### Rulare: apasa "Send Request" deasupra fiecarei cereri, IN ORDINE.
### Token-urile si id-ul obiectului se preiau automat din raspunsurile anterioare.
### La a doua rulare, inregistrarile dau "username deja folosit" - e normal, login-ul merge in continuare.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@parola = parola123


### ---------- 1. Conturi ----------

### Inregistrare vanzator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vanzator_demo",
  "email": "vanzator_demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Inregistrare cumparator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cumparator_demo",
  "email": "cumparator_demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Login vanzator (token-ul se salveaza automat)
# @name loginVanzator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vanzator_demo",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Login cumparator (token-ul se salveaza automat)
# @name loginCumparator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cumparator_demo",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Profilul meu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 2. Obiecte ----------

### Vanzatorul pune un obiect la licitatie (2 minute, ca sa vezi inchiderea)
# @name creareObiect
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Ceas de buzunar vechi",
  "description": "Functioneaza, are o zgarietura pe capac",
  "startPrice": 100.00,
  "durationInMinutes": 2
}

### Toate obiectele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Doar licitatiile deschise
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/active
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Detaliile obiectului creat mai sus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Obiectele puse la licitatie de vanzator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/my
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 3. Licitare ----------

### Cumparatorul liciteaza (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 150.00
}

### EROARE asteptata: oferta prea mica (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 120.00
}

### EROARE asteptata: vanzatorul liciteaza la propriul obiect (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Istoricul ofertelor pentru obiect (de la cea mai mare)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

### Ofertele mele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/my
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Cumparatorul urmareste obiectul (lista de favorite, "Urmaresc")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Obiectele urmarite de cumparator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/watched
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### EROARE asteptata: vanzatorul isi urmareste propriul obiect (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

### Cumparatorul nu mai urmareste obiectul
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 4. Dupa inchiderea licitatiei ----------
### Asteapta ~2-3 minute (durata + verificarea care ruleaza o data pe minut)

### Obiectele castigate de cumparator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/won
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### EROARE asteptata: licitatie incheiata (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 1000.00
}


### ---------- 5. Erori de validare si autentificare ----------

### EROARE asteptata: date invalide la inregistrare (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "email": "nu-e-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### EROARE asteptata: obiect fara nume si cu pret negativ (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "",
  "startPrice": -5
}

### EROARE asteptata: fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items

### EROARE asteptata: token invalid (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer token-inventat
